# MCP production rules (tools/mcp/)

Full skill: `.cursor/skills/mcp-production-rules/SKILL.md`. Fire these four gates BEFORE any MCP/CLI art or geometry call. Any failure = hard stop; propose the compliant alternative instead.

| Gate | Constraint | Blocks |
|---|---|---|
| `no_ai_generated_images` | No diffusion/LLM-freeform for FINAL assets | base64 textures, "generate an image", diffusion output |
| `deterministic_output` | Same input + same seed ⇒ same output | unseeded variation, random-per-run |
| `batch_processing` | Process groups/atlases, not ad-hoc singles | one-off tile, single-prop production bakes |
| `grid_alignment` | Fixed grid unit, no free rotation | free-rotated props, off-grid placement |

Emit before executing — never silently proceed:

```yaml
rules_check: { passed: true|false, blocked_by: [<rule_id>...], seed: "<seed>" }
```

Blocked → propose the compliant path ("describe mesh in chat" → a `geometry_job_v1` JSON; "quick texture" → keyframe render pack).

## Witness honesty
Never emit `green` over a failing or un-run tree. `honest_gate: dishonest_gate` blocks promotion. A witness must reflect the tree on disk, not an earlier state.
